  "as_of": "2025-02-12",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would create a registration system for phone and internet providers and increase penalties for breaking consumer rules.",
   "Providers would have to follow industry codes, and the minister could raise the maximum fines the communications regulator can issue.",
   "The bill would amend the Telecommunications Act 1997, but the digest does not specify when the changes would start."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Create a registration system for carriage service providers.",
   "Require providers to comply with industry codes.",
   "Increase pecuniary penalties for breaches.",
   "Expand the minister's authority to increase infringement notice penalties the ACMA can issue."
  ],
  "affected": "Phone and internet providers (carriage service providers) and the Australian Communications and Media Authority (ACMA).",
